今天为了庆祝我们的第100集，我特意穿上了它。

1312
00:55:13.480 --> 00:55:15.020
That is so cool.
那太酷了。

1313
00:55:15.240 --> 00:55:16.300
Here's our picture, Jenna.
这是我们的合影，珍娜。

1314
00:55:16.480 --> 00:55:16.960
I'll show you.
我给你看。

1315
00:55:17.300 --> 00:55:18.520
Look at us on the ice.
看我们在冰上的样子。

1316
00:55:18.680 --> 00:55:19.880
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1317
00:55:20.320 --> 00:55:20.900
Isn't that cool?
是不是很酷？

1318
00:55:21.020 --> 00:55:22.140
It was such a fun day.
那天真的很有趣。

1319
00:55:22.440 --> 00:55:25.000
Were you nervous when you were walking on the ice?
你在冰上走的时候紧张吗？

1320
00:55:25.060 --> 00:55:25.500
I was.
我很紧张。

1321
00:55:25.820 --> 00:55:26.900
Because you just wear your regular shoes.
因为你穿的只是普通的鞋子。

1322
00:55:26.900 --> 00:55:27.380
I was.
我是挺紧张的。

1323
00:55:27.380 --> 00:55:28.940
And I had these little boots on.
我当时穿着这些小靴子。

1324
00:55:29.000 --> 00:55:32.260
And I was like, dear Lord, please don't let me bust my butt in front of all these people.
我心想，天哪，千万别让我在这么多人面前摔个屁股墩儿。

1325
00:55:32.420 --> 00:55:34.260
Did they have little carpets down or no?
他们有没有铺小地毯之类的？

1326
00:55:34.260 --> 00:55:38.240
At the beginning, but then we walked all the way to the center, and there was no more carpet.
刚开始有，但后来我们一直走到中心位置，那里就没有地毯了。

1327
00:55:38.460 --> 00:55:38.740
Yes.
是的。

1328
00:55:38.860 --> 00:55:43.240
I got to go to the All-Stars game in St. Louis.
我有幸去了圣路易斯的全明星赛。

1329
00:55:43.340 --> 00:55:44.560
Oh, so cool.
噢，太酷了。

1330
00:55:44.880 --> 00:55:46.900
And I got to be like a coach on the sideline.
我还在场边当了一回教练。

1331
00:55:47.120 --> 00:55:47.170
Did you really?
真的吗？

1332
00:55:47.170 --> 00:55:48.380
It was really fun, yes.
真的很有趣，是的。

1333
00:55:48.640 --> 00:55:51.380
And then at the end, I had to walk out on the ice.
最后我不得不走到冰面上。

1334
00:55:51.600 --> 00:55:51.900
Yeah.
是啊。

1335
00:55:52.000 --> 00:55:55.260
And I was so nervous that I was going to fall.
我当时特别紧张，生怕自己摔倒。

1336
00:55:55.740 --> 00:56:02.820
And David Pasternak from the Boston Bruins, he came over, and he gave me his arm.
波士顿棕熊队的大卫·帕斯特纳克走过来，挽住了我的胳膊。

1337
00:56:02.820 --> 00:56:05.820
And it was like a big fangirl moment for me.
那对我来说简直是大型追星现场。

1338
00:56:06.040 --> 00:56:07.900
Well, I held Kate Flannery's arm.
好吧，我当时是挽着凯特·弗兰纳里的胳膊。

1339
00:56:09.340 --> 00:56:11.080
Who did the Penguins play that day?
那天企鹅队是对阵谁？

1340
00:56:11.440 --> 00:56:14.300
Oh, they played the Albany River Rats.
噢，他们对阵的是奥尔巴尼河鼠队。

1341
00:56:14.500 --> 00:56:14.960
Oh.
噢。

1342
00:56:15.260 --> 00:56:15.640
Yeah.
是啊。

1343
00:56:15.900 --> 00:56:17.120
I just love hockey.
我就是喜欢冰球。

1344
00:56:17.380 --> 00:56:18.700
I can't say it more times.
怎么说都不够。

1345
00:56:18.700 --> 00:56:20.500
I have to say, it was a really fun time.
我得说，那段时光真的非常快乐。

1346
00:56:20.980 --> 00:56:25.740
Well, Michael's thing with the tickets is going to work, because Dwight is going to get
迈克尔关于门票的计划会奏效的，因为德怀特会接到

1347
00:56:25.740 --> 00:56:29.840
a call from Mr. Schofield, and he's going to say he's leaning toward Michael Scott Paper
斯科菲尔德先生的电话，他会说他倾向于选择迈克尔·斯科特造纸

1348
00:56:29.840 --> 00:56:30.340
Company.
公司。

1349
00:56:31.240 --> 00:56:32.740
So, Dwight calls Michael.
所以，德怀特给迈克尔打了电话。

1350
00:56:32.820 --> 00:56:37.280
He's like, I will agree to meet you 100 feet from our original meeting place.
他说，我同意在距离我们原定会面地点100英尺的地方见你。

1351
00:56:37.360 --> 00:56:39.220
They're not going to meet at their same secret location.
他们不会在同一个秘密地点见面了。

1352
00:56:39.360 --> 00:56:39.410
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

1353
00:56:39.410 --> 00:56:40.280
Mix it up, guys.
换个地方，伙计们。

1354
00:56:40.460 --> 00:56:42.740
100 feet away at high noon.
正午时分，在一百英尺外。

1355
00:56:43.100 --> 00:56:43.560
Yes.
没错。

1356
00:56:43.720 --> 00:56:47.860
And Michael tells Dwight to walk 100 feet toward the sun.
然后迈克尔告诉德怀特向太阳的方向走一百英尺。

1357
00:56:48.180 --> 00:56:49.860
But that's right above you.
但那就在你头顶正上方啊。

1358
00:56:50.160 --> 00:56:51.300
It's not possible.
这不可能。

1359
00:56:51.600 --> 00:56:52.680
Dwight's clearly confused.
德怀特显然困惑了。

1360
00:56:53.060 --> 00:56:55.820
I have a whole thing about Dwight's undies.
我关于德怀特的内裤有一整套想法。

1361
00:56:56.120 --> 00:56:56.820
Oh, yes.
哦，是的。

1362
00:56:56.820 --> 00:56:59.900
We're going to see some green undies on Dwight.
我们要看到德怀特穿绿内裤了。

1363
00:57:00.040 --> 00:57:00.580
Of course.
当然。

1364
00:57:00.580 --> 00:57:01.580
Of course we will.
我们肯定会看到的。

1365
00:57:01.680 --> 00:57:04.780
Not just undies, but a whole torso, the whole shebang.
不只是内裤，还有整个躯干，全套装备。

1366
00:57:05.180 --> 00:57:09.260
There is nothing Rainn Wilson loves more than exposing his torso.
雷恩·威尔逊最喜欢做的事莫过于展示他的躯干了。

1367
00:57:09.460 --> 00:57:11.080
It's exposing Dwight's belly.
这是在展示德怀特的肚子。

1368
00:57:11.180 --> 00:57:11.780
It's true.
确实如此。

1369
00:57:12.540 --> 00:57:13.740
I had to know.
我必须得弄清楚。

1370
00:57:13.920 --> 00:57:14.920
I took a screen grab.
我截了图。

1371
00:57:15.100 --> 00:57:16.260
I texted it to Rainn.
我发短信给了雷恩。

1372
00:57:16.320 --> 00:57:19.560
And I said, Rainn, are these your green undies?
我说，雷恩，这是你的绿内裤吗？

1373
00:57:19.620 --> 00:57:20.800
Were they actually yours?
真的是你的吗？

1374
00:57:21.100 --> 00:57:22.760
And this is what he wrote back.
这是他回复的内容。

1375
00:57:22.900 --> 00:57:26.340
And I quote, those were provided by wardrobe, my love.
我引用一下，亲爱的，那是服装组提供的。

1376
00:57:26.820 --> 00:57:27.220
Aw.
噢。

1377
00:57:27.220 --> 00:57:33.080
So I said, oh, my God, Rainn, you had to have a wardrobe meeting about underwear.
所以我说，天哪，雷恩，你还得专门开个服装会议来讨论内裤啊。

1378
00:57:33.300 --> 00:57:35.140
And these were the pair that were picked.
然后这就是被选中的那一条。

1379
00:57:35.360 --> 00:57:40.000
It's interesting because if you look, there are a few other times on the show where Dwight
很有趣，因为如果你仔细看，剧里还有几次德怀特

1380
00:57:40.000 --> 00:57:42.320
is in his underwear, like when he's sleeping on the couch.
穿着内裤，比如他在沙发上睡觉的时候。

1381
00:57:42.420 --> 00:57:42.700
Yes.
是的。

1382
00:57:43.200 --> 00:57:47.420
We had a fan question from Joanna K., Margaret F., and Natalia L.
我们收到了乔安娜·K、玛格丽特·F和娜塔莉亚·L的粉丝提问。

1383
00:57:47.420 --> 00:57:52.040
Well, during the scene where Dwight is buckling his pants after showing Michael that he isn't
嗯，在德怀特向迈克尔证明他没带窃听器后扣裤子的那一幕里，

