Lady, we skipped something a while back and I want to bring it up.
女士，我们刚才跳过了一件事，我想提一下。

1432
00:59:32.620 --> 00:59:39.200
It's when Andy's in the kitchen and Jim enters and he's doing like this whole melodrama of
就是安迪在厨房里，吉姆走进来，他正在上演一出苦情戏，

1433
00:59:39.200 --> 00:59:40.500
