搞砸了一个销售电话。

1434
00:59:40.660 --> 00:59:41.920
He's beating himself up and he.
他在自责，而且他。

1435
00:59:42.040 --> 00:59:43.640
It's like he's in a soap opera.
就像在演肥皂剧一样。

1436
00:59:43.800 --> 00:59:44.140
Yes.
没错。

1437
00:59:44.420 --> 00:59:47.680
And then he like drop kicks his lunch across the room.
然后他像踢球一样把午餐踢到了房间另一头。

1438
00:59:48.000 --> 00:59:48.860
And steps on it.
还踩了上去。

1439
00:59:48.860 --> 00:59:51.220
But yes, we got some fan mail.
不过确实，我们收到了一些粉丝来信。

1440
00:59:51.380 --> 00:59:53.680
People wanted to know if that lunch bit was an improv.
人们想知道那个午餐片段是不是即兴表演。

1441
00:59:54.320 --> 00:59:55.340
It was not.
并不是。

1442
00:59:55.600 --> 00:59:59.680
In fact, in the script, it said Jim drop kicks his lunch bag.
事实上，剧本里写的就是吉姆把午餐袋踢飞。

1443
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.600
So I just want to say what that means.
所以我只是想说明一下这意味着什么。

1444
01:00:01.600 --> 01:00:06.480
When there's that simple line in a script that says Jim drop kicks his lunch bag.
当剧本里出现“吉姆把午餐袋踢飞”这样简单的台词时。

1445
01:00:06.720 --> 01:00:11.480
When Phil Shea is going through a script and he sees that sentence, he's going to highlight
当菲尔·谢伊审阅剧本看到这句话时，他会把它高亮出来。

1446
01:00:11.480 --> 01:00:11.900
that.
没错。

1447
01:00:12.240 --> 01:00:12.360
Right.
他会去制片组问，你们觉得这场戏要拍多少条？

1448
01:00:12.780 --> 01:00:17.680
He's going to go to production and he's going to say, how many takes of the scene do you
我需要准备多少个午餐袋？

1449
01:00:17.680 --> 01:00:18.260
think we'll do?
你们觉得这场戏要拍多少条？

1450
01:00:18.860 --> 01:00:20.740
How many lunch bags do I need to make?
我需要准备多少个午餐袋？

1451
01:00:20.900 --> 01:00:22.620
How many sandwiches do I need to make?
我需要做多少个三明治？

1452
01:00:22.720 --> 01:00:23.140
All of it.
全部。

1453
01:00:23.280 --> 01:00:28.160
He'll probably also go to John and say, what are the odds you improvised taking a bite of
他大概还会去找约翰说，你踢完之后顺便咬一口的几率有多大？

1454
01:00:28.160 --> 01:00:29.100
it after you kick it?
踢完之后。

1455
01:00:29.220 --> 01:00:30.840
What kind of sandwich do you want in there?
你想在里面放什么样的三明治？

1456
01:00:31.120 --> 01:00:31.480
Everything.
什么都放。

1457
01:00:32.020 --> 01:00:33.740
He would be so meticulous.
他会非常一丝不苟。

1458
01:00:33.740 --> 01:00:38.440
And then he would have to make a bunch of identical lunch bags.
然后他得准备一堆一模一样的午餐袋。

1459
01:00:38.720 --> 01:00:45.060
And then like before, we would have a crew member off camera ready to fly in.
就像之前一样，我们会安排一个工作人员在镜头外随时准备入场。

1460
01:00:45.220 --> 01:00:46.200
That's the lingo.
那是行话。

1461
01:00:46.420 --> 01:00:48.260
Fly in a new lunch bag.
送入一个新的午餐袋。

1462
01:00:48.260 --> 01:00:52.620
And they would also probably have John try to kick it into the same corner every time.
而且他们大概还会让约翰每次都试着把它踢进同一个角落。

1463
01:00:52.620 --> 01:00:53.280
Yes.
没错。

1464
01:00:53.520 --> 01:00:57.920
That is how that little bitty sentence affected a bunch of people.
这就是那句简短的话如何影响了一群人。

1465
01:00:58.440 --> 01:01:01.340
Now, lady, it's time to go to Alfredo's.
好了，女士，该去阿尔弗雷多餐厅了。

