1467
01:01:02.460 --> 01:01:05.340
Michael, Pam, and Ryan are going to go to Alfredo's.
迈克尔、帕姆和瑞安要去阿尔弗雷多餐厅。

1468
01:01:05.420 --> 01:01:10.460
They're supposed to be meeting Dwight there because they're supposed to be like reconciling
他们本该在那里见德怀特，因为他们本该在阿尔弗雷多披萨咖啡馆

1469
01:01:10.460 --> 01:01:12.280
at Alfredo's Pizza Cafe.
和解。

1470
01:01:12.500 --> 01:01:17.360
Dwight is such a good liar because I feel like the lying is in the details.
德怀特真是个出色的骗子，因为我觉得撒谎的关键在于细节。

