They took a dead fish and they put it in the back of this guy Nick's toilet.
他们拿了一条死鱼，塞进了那个叫尼克的家伙的马桶水箱里。

1540
01:03:36.720 --> 01:03:41.120
They lifted the back of the toilet and they put that fish in the toilet water, you know,
他们掀开马桶水箱盖，把鱼放进了马桶水箱的水里，你知道的，

1541
