We would go over to Nick.
我们会去尼克那边。

1552
01:03:58.020 --> 01:04:02.440
He lived in a house with a group of guys and we'd be like, God, Nick, your house stinks.
他跟一群男生合租，我们就会说，天哪，尼克，你们家太臭了。

1553
