大概一个月都没查出是什么问题。

1556
01:04:11.960 --> 01:04:13.360
Oh, this is so disgusting.
噢，这太恶心了。

1557
01:04:13.660 --> 01:04:14.640
It's so disgusting.
真是太恶心了。

1558
01:04:14.860 --> 01:04:21.580
And then there's a certain point where the smell really zeroes in on one area and he finally
后来有一次，那股臭味集中到了一个地方，他终于

1559
