1561
01:04:27.680 --> 01:04:33.160
He wasn't noticing that like the water in his toilet was affected?
他难道没发现他家马桶里的水有问题吗？

1562
01:04:33.540 --> 01:04:34.640
I don't know what to tell you, lady.
我不知道该怎么跟你说，女士。

1563
01:04:34.800 --> 01:04:35.720
I don't know what to tell you.
我不知道该怎么跟你说。

1564
01:04:35.880 --> 01:04:37.580
